('state-machine','advanced','What is a safety property?',ARRAY['Something bad never happens','Something good eventually happens','System is fast','System is stable'],0,'Safety: ''never enter error state'' (invariance).',20),
('state-machine','advanced','What is a hazard-free FSM design?',ARRAY['No glitches in output or state','Fast FSM','Small FSM','Low-power FSM'],0,'Hazard-free: Gray code + Moore outputs avoid glitches.',20),
('state-machine','advanced','What is a clock-gated FSM?',ARRAY['Clock disabled for idle states to save power','Faster clock','More states','Fewer states'],0,'Clock gating: disable FF clock when state is idle.',20),
('state-machine','advanced','What is a power-aware state encoding?',ARRAY['Minimizes bit transitions between frequent states','Maximizes transitions','Random encoding','Binary encoding'],0,'Power-aware: assign codes to minimize switching activity.',20),
('state-machine','advanced','What is a scan chain in FSM testing?',ARRAY['Flip-flops chained for test access','Gate-level testing','Power testing','Timing testing'],0,'Scan chain: serial shift in/out for testability (DFT).',20),
('state-machine','advanced','What is ATPG?',ARRAY['Automatic Test Pattern Generation','Automatic Timing Pattern Generator','Analog Test Power Generator','Automatic Transition Path Generator'],0,'ATPG: generates test vectors for fault coverage.',20),
